relaxios/axios (src/axios) is a TypeScript port of axios 1.20.0 (lib/, index.js and
index.d.ts), file by file, with the same module names. Its Node transport also
reimplements the behavior of the follow-redirects, proxy-from-env, https-proxy-agent
and form-data packages that axios depends on. axios is distributed under this license:

